            "body": "From the linked coc.nvim issue:\n\n\n> for some reason it's adding the statusline to the float window\n\nThat is intentional (see [news-0.12.txt](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/d1fd8158de63107d2ada9f69c1a491d76edfc9aa/runtime/doc/news-0.12.txt#L111-L112)). If you don't want a statusline in the floatwin, disable it locally:\n\n    :setlocal statusline=",
